OL,3,ATrump welcomes Xi at airport with red
OL,4,Acarpet and military flyover to kick off
OL,5,Athree-day US visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump and Xi
OL,8,FJinping shake hands at a rare airport
OL,9,Fwelcome to kick off a three-day visit
OL,10,Fto the US - watch live above
OL,12,FA flyover by a pair of B-1 bombers, a
OL,13,Fbattery salute from cannons, and a
OL,14,F100-foot (30m) red carpet were all part
OL,15,Fof the ornate ceremony to welcome the
OL,16,FChinese delegation
OL,18,FTariffs, AI, the Iran war and Taiwan
OL,19,Fare among the key issues the pair could
OL,20,Fdiscuss this week, but what does each
OL,21,Fside want?
